  DTS:Description="Ingest NA partner sales files (comma-delimited, code page 1252, MM/DD/YYYY dates, H header and T footer records). The footer carries the detail record count; state and county sales tax arrive as separate columns and are summed into a single tax amount. Malformed detail rows go to err.RejectedFileRow and the reject file; the file is archived either way."
